<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the</p>
<p>following Brazilian soybean and products basis levels.</p>
<p>(NS - no seller T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount, NB - no bidder)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	     25/18 D	April	   30/20 D</p>
<p> May		 25/18 D	May	     24/16 D</p>
<p> July		15/6  D	July	    15/12 D</p>
<p> August	    15/25 P	August	  13/18 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	     15/10 D	April	   20/18 D</p>
<p> May		 21/16 D	May	     20/18 D</p>
<p> July		21/19 D	July	    21/19 D</p>
<p> August	     7/3  D     August	   7/4.5 D</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	 BASIS	   MONTH	  PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	     NS/NB	  April	  110/90  D</p>
<p> May		506/510*	May	    140/115 D</p>
<p> July	     506/510*	July	   170/135 D</p>
<p> August	    NS/NB	  August	 170/135 D</p>
<p>* outright prices in dollars per tonne</p>
